      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i thought it might be sugar, but i'm also seeing some areas where it looks more like a white, waxy film rather than just powder. could that be fat bloom instead? and if so, how does the cocoa butter crystallization process during tempering actually work to prevent that specifically?",
